  <section class="page-intro about-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the artist</p>
    <h1>William Payne</h1>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p>I'm a metal artist and sculptor based in rural Frostproof, Florida. Working with steel and stainless steel, I create works that question the ordinary. I take inspiration from all directions, including nature, music, and poetry.</p>
      <p>I'm drawn to large-scale sculpture that challenges both the material and myself. I find purpose in the physical work: cutting, grinding, bending, and welding until flat, lifeless metal begins to transform from work into a work of art.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
